Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `pair.right` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/lambda_capture_access_is_projection_specific_and_transitive_2.jet:12:13
    |
 12 |     }, pair.right)
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `pair.right` only once, or copy first with `pair.right.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
